  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider the following complex ions, P, Q and R.<br ><img src=\"assets\\qt0028_a3342d8729ec.png\"/> <br >The correct order of the complex ions, according to their spin-only magnetic moment values (in B.M.) is</p>"
